  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - Natural Gas Infrastructure, through Innovation Network LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This definitional mission (DM) identified and evaluated project opportunities in the realm of natural gas infrastructure development and utilization in Indonesia. The DM Contractor worked with previous USTDA project sponsors such as PT PLN (Persero) and Perusahaan Gas Negara (PGN) and private sector interests to assess prospective projects in the realm of gas pipeline development, gas receiving terminals, combined cycle power plants, liquefied natural gas (LNG) terminals and other areas that would advance economic development as well as U.S. commercial interests in Indonesia&apos;s natural gas sector.</narrative>
  </description>
